OL,3,GNEWSAAirport baggage systems hit by
OL,4,Apower outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Airport has said a number
OL,7,Fof its systems have been affected by a
OL,8,Fpower cut.
OL,10,FThe airport in Castle Donington,
OL,11,FLeicestershire, said its baggage
OL,12,Fservice was out of action after a
OL,13,F"brief" power cut on Monday.
OL,15,FIn a statement at about 12:15 BST the
OL,16,Fairport said engineers had fixed the
OL,17,Fissue and the airport is "returning to
OL,18,Fnormal operations".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
