OL,3,GNEWSAAirport baggage systems hit by
OL,4,Apower outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers have been advised to go to
OL,7,Fthe airport as usual, with a
OL,8,Fspokesperson advising any who become
OL,9,F"separated from their luggage" to stay
OL,10,Fin contact with their airline who will
OL,11,Freunite them at their destination.
